msgid ""
"Add audit hooks for :func:`gc.get_objects`, :func:`gc.get_referrers` and "
":func:`gc.get_referents`."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan audit hook untuk :func:`gc.get_objects`\\ , "
":func:`gc.get_referrers` dan :func:`gc.get_referents`\\ ."

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:153
msgid "`hashlib <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.10.html#hashlib>`_"
msgstr "`hashlib <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.10.html#hashlib>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:155
msgid "The hashlib module requires OpenSSL 1.1.1 or newer."
msgstr "Modul hashlib memerlukan OpenSSL 1.1.1 atau yang lebih baru."

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:157
msgid "The hashlib module has preliminary support for OpenSSL 3.0.0."
msgstr "Modul hashlib memiliki dukungan awal untuk OpenSSL 3.0.0."

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:159
msgid ""
"The pure-Python fallback of :func:`~hashlib.pbkdf2_hmac` is deprecated. In "
"the future PBKDF2-HMAC will only be available when Python has been built "
"with OpenSSL support."
msgstr ""
"Fallback pure-Python dari :func:`~hashlib.pbkdf2_hmac` sudah deprecated. Di "
"masa mendatang PBKDF2-HMAC hanya akan tersedia ketika Python dibangun dengan"
" dukungan OpenSSL."

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:163
msgid "`os <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.10.html#os>`_"
msgstr "`os <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.10.html#os>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:165
msgid "Add :func:`os.cpu_count()` support for VxWorks RTOS."
msgstr "Tambahkan dukungan :func:`os.cpu_count()` untuk VxWorks RTOS."

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:167
msgid ""
"Add a new function :func:`os.eventfd` and related helpers to wrap the "
"``eventfd2`` syscall on Linux."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan fungsi baru :func:`os.eventfd` dan helper terkait untuk membungkus"
" syscall ``eventfd2`` di Linux."

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:170
msgid ""
"Add :func:`os.splice()` that allows to move data between two file "
"descriptors without copying between kernel address space and user address "
"space, where one of the file descriptors must refer to a pipe."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan :func:`os.splice()` yang memungkinkan pemindahan data antara dua "
"deskriptor file tanpa penyalinan antara ruang alamat kernel dan ruang alamat"
" pengguna, di mana salah satu deskriptor file harus merujuk ke pipe."

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:175
msgid ""
"Add :data:`~os.O_EVTONLY`, :data:`~os.O_FSYNC`, :data:`~os.O_SYMLINK` and "
":data:`~os.O_NOFOLLOW_ANY` for macOS."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan :data:`~os.O_EVTONLY`\\ , :data:`~os.O_FSYNC`\\ , "
":data:`~os.O_SYMLINK` dan :data:`~os.O_NOFOLLOW_ANY` untuk macOS."

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:178
msgid "`platform <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.10.html#platform>`_"
msgstr "`platform <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.10.html#platform>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:180
msgid ""
"Add :func:`platform.freedesktop_os_release()` to retrieve operation system "
"identification from `freedesktop.org os-release "
"<https://www.freedesktop.org/software/systemd/man/os-release.html>`_ "
"standard file."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan :func:`platform.freedesktop_os_release()` untuk mengambil "
"identifikasi sistem operasi dari file standar `freedesktop.org os-release "
"<https://www.freedesktop.org/software/systemd/man/os-release.html>`_\\ ."

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:184
msgid "`socket <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.10.html#socket>`_"
msgstr "`socket <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.10.html#socket>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:186
msgid ""
"The exception :exc:`socket.timeout` is now an alias of :exc:`TimeoutError`."
msgstr ""
"Pengecualian :exc:`socket.timeout` kini merupakan alias dari "
":exc:`TimeoutError`\\ ."

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:188
msgid "Add option to create MPTCP sockets with ``IPPROTO_MPTCP``."
msgstr "Tambahkan opsi untuk membuat socket MPTCP dengan ``IPPROTO_MPTCP``\\ ."

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:190
msgid ""
"Add ``IP_RECVTOS`` option to receive the type of service (ToS) or DSCP/ECN "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan opsi ``IP_RECVTOS`` untuk menerima tipe layanan (ToS) atau field "
"DSCP/ECN."

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:192
msgid "`ssl <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.10.html#ssl>`_"
msgstr "`ssl <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.10.html#ssl>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:194
msgid "The ssl module requires OpenSSL 1.1.1 or newer."
msgstr "Modul ssl memerlukan OpenSSL 1.1.1 atau yang lebih baru."

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:196
msgid ""
"The ssl module has preliminary support for OpenSSL 3.0.0 and new option "
":data:`~ssl.OP_IGNORE_UNEXPECTED_EOF`."
msgstr ""
"Modul ssl memiliki dukungan awal untuk OpenSSL 3.0.0 dan opsi baru "
":data:`~ssl.OP_IGNORE_UNEXPECTED_EOF`\\ ."

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:199
msgid ""
"Deprecated function and use of deprecated constants now result in a "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning`. :attr:`ssl.SSLContext.options` has "
":data:`~ssl.OP_NO_SSLv2` and :data:`~ssl.OP_NO_SSLv3` set by default and "
"therefore cannot warn about setting the flag again."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi yang sudah deprecated dan penggunaan konstanta deprecated kini "
"menghasilkan :exc:`DeprecationWarning`\\ . :attr:`ssl.SSLContext.options` "
"memiliki :data:`~ssl.OP_NO_SSLv2` dan :data:`~ssl.OP_NO_SSLv3` yang diset "
"secara default sehingga tidak dapat memperingatkan tentang pengaturan flag "
"tersebut lagi."

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:204
msgid ""
"The ssl module now has more secure default settings. Ciphers without forward"
" secrecy or SHA-1 MAC are disabled by default. Security level 2 prohibits "
"weak RSA, DH, and ECC keys with less than 112 bits of security. "
":class:`~ssl.SSLContext` defaults to minimum protocol version TLS 1.2. "
"Settings are based on Hynek Schlawack's research."
msgstr ""
"Modul ssl kini memiliki pengaturan default yang lebih aman. Cipher tanpa "
"forward secrecy atau SHA-1 MAC dinonaktifkan secara default. Level keamanan "
"2 melarang kunci RSA, DH, dan ECC yang lemah dengan kurang dari 112 bit "
"keamanan. :class:`~ssl.SSLContext` default ke versi protokol minimum TLS "
"1.2. Pengaturan didasarkan pada penelitian Hynek Schlawack."

#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:210
msgid ""
"The deprecated protocols SSL 3.0, TLS 1.0, and TLS 1.1 are no longer "
"officially supported. Python does not block them actively. However OpenSSL "
"build options, distro configurations, vendor patches, and cipher suites may "
"prevent a successful handshake."
msgstr ""
"Protokol yang sudah deprecated SSL 3.0, TLS 1.0, dan TLS 1.1 tidak lagi "
"didukung secara resmi. Python tidak memblokir mereka secara aktif. Namun "
"opsi build OpenSSL, konfigurasi distro, patch vendor, dan suite cipher "
"mungkin mencegah handshake yang berhasil."

